/// A single MIR -> trust-ir `<[T]>::split_first` / `split_last` niche
/// `Option<(&T, &[T])>` VALUE refinement obligation set (Phase P1, TRANSLATION
/// VALIDATION of the interception — lane 6). Discharged in `mir_to_trust_ir`:
/// the exact trust-ir the bridge EMITTED for the split (the `ICmp Ne(len,0)`
/// emptiness test, the `Sub(len,1)` tail length, the kind-dependent
/// `emit_element_addr` arithmetic, and `store_option_some_value`'s RefAndSlice
