/// flows through `discharge_refinement`. THE NICHE KEYSTONE: `niche_at_f0` is
/// derived from the LAYOUT's designated tag offset at capture time — never from
/// where the emitted `Select` flowed — so a DROPPED `Select` (the raw pointer
/// stored unconditionally into the niche cell; an empty slice would decode
